        CanPickUpLoot: 0b,
        CustomNameVisible: 1b,
        DialogData: {
            Type: "BASIC",
            DialogDataSet: [
                {
                    Priority: 10,
                    Buttons: [
                        {
                            Name: "Goodbye",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "CLOSE_DIALOG"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "goodbye_button"
                        }
                    ],
                    Texts: [
                        {
                            Text: "You met the bogged up top? I made that. Summoned it myself, out of the mushroom-damp and a book I am absolutely not supposed to have. It is a servant for the witch of the North Rise house. Puddle assisted. Puddle, tell them you assisted. ...He is being modest. He held the candle."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "The witch does not come down. Ever. Nobody has seen her, which is the proof — the important ones are always the ones you do not see. She required a keeper for the rise, so I provided one. Bog and bones and one borrowed word I will not be repeating. Worked first try. Mostly first try."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "If you are carrying rotten flesh, take it up top to the bogged. It is the rent — the witch counts it, the bogged eats it, everyone up the chain stays pleasant. It does not bite unless she says, and she has said nothing yet, which I choose to read as approval of my work."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "Auntie Bramblea says the gym leader trains blindfolded. Wrong. Titania is a GHOST, and ghosts do not need eyes. Nobody I know has seen her up close. I know how the unseen operate now. Professionally."
                        }
                    ],
                    Name: "Thistrel Fogroot",
                    Label: "default"
                }
            ]
        },
